#: generalpageimpl.cpp:51
msgid ""
"<h1>General Setup</h1>You can configure general display options here. For "
"example whether you want to enable the Ctrl+Alt+Backspace keyboard shortcut "
"for shutting down the display."
msgstr ""

#: keyboardpageimpl.cpp:208
msgid ""
"<h1>Select Keyboard Type</h1>"
"<p>In this screen you select your keyboard <em>model</em> (in the top "
"window) and the keyboard <em>layout</em> (in the bottom window). The model "
"of the keyboard describes the keyboard hardware. The layout determines "
"things like what character will appear on the screen when you press a "
"key.</p>"
msgstr ""

